        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan picks up a strand of scribe grass from the purple sand. While it sits on the sand it looks sound, but the moment he lifts it, it withers and turns into fine purple sand identical to the ground underfoot. Other immortal materials in the field do the same once taken from the sand, leaving the whole display unusable.",
